    "title": "SF Giants blown out by Yankees in Vitello's managerial debut - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago SAN FRANCISCO — Tony Vitello, like any baseball fan, has always loved the tradition of Opening Day. The pomp. The pagentry. The tradition. Tradition, however, would be an improper adjective to describe the festivities ahead of the Giants’ 7-0 loss to the New York Yankees on Wednesday at Oracle Park, which served as Opening Night for all of Major League Baseball as Netflix leaned all the way into the pregame theatrics. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
